    "footprints":
      "The footprints are leading to the north and east. Lots of beings "
      "walked here recently.\n",
    "footprint":
      "The footprints are leading to the north and east. Lots of beings "
      "walked here recently.\n",
    "mark":
      "The footprints are leading to the north and east. Lots of beings "
      "walked here recently.\n",
    "marks":
      "The footprints are leading to the north and east. Lots of beings "
      "walked here recently.\n",
    "being":
      "Their footprints are marked into the dirt on the floor. "
      "There are several different marks here though. Some small, "
