    "other things":
      "There are some things floating on the water too. You are not "
      "able to identify them anymore. They are too rotten.\n",
  ]);
}

string query_short() { return "Tower basement, western end"; }

string query_long() {
  return
    "This is the western end of the room. To the north is a big "
    "wheel, where the chain is stored. At the western wall is a "
    "big machine and to the south is an opening, where the chain "
    "runs through.\n";
}

string long() { return query_long(); }

string query_exit(string dir) {
  if (!exits || !dir)
    return 0;
  return exits[dir];
}

string query_exit_string() {
  return "The obvious exits are east and north.\n";
}

string query_item(string s) {
  if (!extras || !s)
    return 0;
  return extras[s];
}

int id(string str) {
  return str == "tower" || str == "here";
}
